# Job search preferences

## Locations
- Willing to work from: Bangalore, Hyderabad, Pune, or fully remote (India)
- Not willing to relocate outside India
- Remote must mean remote — "remote (US only)" doesn't count

## Work authorization
- Indian citizen, authorized to work in India without sponsorship
- No US/EU work authorization — postings requiring it are an automatic skip

## Salary floor
- Minimum: ₹18,00,000 LPA base, negotiable for strong equity/learning upside
- Below this only worth a "maybe" if the role is an unusually strong fit

## Company size / stage
- Prefer: Series B+ startups, or established product companies
- Skip: pre-seed/seed stage with < 20 employees (too much churn risk)

## Domains I want
- Fintech, developer tools, infrastructure/platform engineering

## Domains I refuse
- Ad-tech, gambling/betting platforms, crypto trading platforms

## Seniority
- Targeting: mid-level IC roles (2-5 years of the relevant stack)
- Not targeting: Staff/Principal/Manager (see hard_filters.md title blocklist)
